title: The Customs War with Germany
subtitle: An urgent card of Industry and Trade: one answer to the customs war.
new-page: true
is-card: true
view-if: {! return !!Q.S && PolishProjects.cardAvailable(Q, 'customs_war') !}
on-arrival: {!
// Card government.customs_war (technical reference 11.9, 17.11). Z — 0.94 (the user's decisions of 24 X 2026; P): an urgent card of
// the Government deck from June 1925 while PPS holds Industry and Trade; one answer for the whole war, which costs no month.
PolishProjects.cardView(Q, 'customs_war');
Q.pl_gc_ministry = PolishProjects.ministryLine(Q, 'polish_gov_customs_war');
!}

= The customs war with Germany

*[+ pl_gc_ministry +]*

In June 1925 Germany closed its market to Polish coal, and Poland answered with bans on imports. Industry is losing its buyers, and credit and output are weakening.

[+ pl_gc_budget +]

- @retaliation
- @new_markets
- @concessions
- @later

@retaliation
title: Answer with retaliatory duties
subtitle: No cost to the budget; home industry keeps the home market and the fall of output weakens. Prices rise (+1 percentage point of inflation for two months).
choose-if: {! return PolishProjects.optionStatus(Q, 'customs_war', 'retaliation').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_customs_war_retaliation_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishProjects.chooseOption(Q, 'customs_war', 'retaliation');
!}
go-to: result

@new_markets
title: Seek new markets
subtitle: Costs 1 budget unit a month for half a year (subsidies for coal exports). The fall of output is halved.
choose-if: {! return PolishProjects.optionStatus(Q, 'customs_war', 'new_markets').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_customs_war_new_markets_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishProjects.chooseOption(Q, 'customs_war', 'new_markets');
!}
go-to: result

@concessions
title: Make concessions to Germany
subtitle: No cost to the budget; trade returns sooner and credit recovers. The National Democrats accuse the cabinet of weakness, and the relation with the National Popular Union worsens (−8).
choose-if: {! return PolishProjects.optionStatus(Q, 'customs_war', 'concessions').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_customs_war_concessions_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishProjects.chooseOption(Q, 'customs_war', 'concessions');
!}
go-to: result

@later
title: Not now
subtitle: The card stays in the hand until PPS answers, at the latest until July 1926.
go-to: root

@result
new-page: true

= The customs war with Germany

[+ pl_gc_result +]

- @root: Continue.
